        {
          "text": "Bazobona ibara, abīta ikibi iciza, iciza bakacīta ikibi; bagashira umwiza mu gishingo c’umuco, n’umuco mu gishingo c’umwiza; bagashira ibirura mu gishingo c’ibisosa, n’ibisosa mu gishingo c’ibirura!",
