        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, nk’ukw ibirimi vy’umuriro bitongora ibirararara, kandi nk’uk’ ubgatsi bgumye bunyikira mu muriro, ni kw igishitsi cabo kizoba nk’ikibore, n’amashurwe yabo azotumuka nk’umukungugu: kuko bāgaye ivyagezwe vy’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, bagakēngēra ijambo ry’Uwera w’Abisirayeli.",
