              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co catumye uburake bg’Uhoraho buziriringira abantu biwe, akababangurira ukuboko, akabakubita, imisozi ikaja mu gatengo, maz’ imivyimba yabo ikamera nk’imyanda hagati mu mayira. Yamara na ho nyene uburake bgiwe ntiburahwama, arik’ ukuboko kwiwe kuracabanguye.",
