          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri bo nta wuzoruha canke ngw atsitare, nta wuzohunyiza canke ngw asinzire; n’umukanda bakenyeje ntuzokenyuruka, kandi n’utugozi tw’inkweto zabo ntituzocika; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "imyampi yabo irasongoye, n’imiheto yabo yose irabanze; inzāra z’amafarasi yabo zizomera nk’isare, n’amakurudumu y’imikogote yabo azogenda nk’agashururu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukwivuga kwabo kuzoba nk’ukw’ intambge, bazokwivuga nk’imigunza y’intambge: ni koko bazotontoma basahura isahu, bayīnyagira, ata wuriho wo gutabara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
